WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.419
Day 3. A new beat at the end of a word.

2
00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:09.681
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.181 --> 00:00:14.087
Here is a word your child can read. Then a new beat goes at the end.

4
00:00:18.442 --> 00:00:19.500
The word is jump.

5
00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:27.682
The word is jumping.

6
00:00:28.582 --> 00:00:33.138
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

7
00:00:33.588 --> 00:00:39.788
Do the four pairs of job one together. The short word first, then the long word, one beat at a time.

8
00:00:40.238 --> 00:00:44.271
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

9
00:00:44.721 --> 00:00:49.449
Cover the second beat with a finger. Read the first one. Then uncover the rest.

10
00:00:50.249 --> 00:00:55.822
For job two, press play for your child and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

11
00:00:56.272 --> 00:00:59.735
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
